{% doc %}
  Renders the site preloader.

  Plays the brand logo (inlined from the header's logo SVG) once per browsing
  session: the cube draws itself edge by edge, then "the", "raw" and "house"
  rise into place before the overlay fades. Repeat pageviews in the same
  session skip it entirely.

  @example
  {% render 'site-preloader' %}
{% enddoc %}

